{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：09:11 2026-08-12 HKT</p>\n<p>今日（12日）早上8時33分，警方接獲多個報案，指西貢布袋澳一號及二號魚排起火，並傳出兩下爆炸聲，其間60多歲男排主救火時手指受傷。消防到場，出動兩喉兩煙帽隊救火，至早上9時22分將火救熄。起火魚排燒至沉沒，另外火勢波及6至8隻纖維快艇亦被燒毀沉沒。</p>\n<img alt=\"現場黑煙密佈。消防處fb圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4cb92ea4275715595b66dee328c1b2f/2026-08/772879846_1557766306029217_4514864046081085892_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防在場射水降溫。消防處提供相片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4fc33b23a60172c6daa164f2b0da239/2026-08/769404960_2580116272405956_4156371560335815187_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場濃煙密佈。消防處fb圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/691dd4b1fdf97a3e710f138402505529/2026-08/770669104_1376788911218785_899194942366911232_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防輪射水救火。消防處提供相片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48410176933b40c3fa36b492ac96c267/2026-08/771519827_1836447584457345_2128301801406490612_n.jpg\"/>\n<p>消防處表示，火警涉及2間寮屋及4艘快艇，現場發現一名約60歲的男傷者，右手輕微燒傷，清醒由救護員於現場作初部治理。</p>\n<p>行動中，消防處共出動94名消防及救護人員、14輛消防車、4艘消防船、1輛救護電單車和2輛救護車，動用2條喉和2隊煙帽隊灌救，火警於早上9時22分被救熄。</p>\n<img alt=\"有漁船燒通頂只剩支架。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd5720340086bebbcc89ce8fffd99325/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_54_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有漁船燒剩支架。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/784a13e39d51df897312f5fdbcf985e4/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_54_39_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有漁船燒通頂只剩支架。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/895fb1782ad43348a6d6150fc9241a1f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_54_39.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批消防在場救火。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a769f9c74cedcf91056ade8f8ea13a36/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_54_41.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a623f7f9d553e2b361e04c4a9d96bf37/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_54_40_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5e56c6b989e8e52e0ddf4871ac0645b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_54_38_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f4a52df293b16e5f0258fbb7c3d3214/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_54_38.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現場消息稱，事發時一艘漁船在船尾位置用整流器為物件充電，其間發生兩次爆炸，船主當時在魚排的寮屋內，打爆玻璃欲用滅火筒救火時手指受傷。其間火勢猛烈，波及其他船隻。</p>\n<p>布袋澳村村長劉先生表示，當時他一出門口見到大片白煙，未幾看見對開船隻著火冒出濃煙，「當時好大火，又大風。」</p>\n<p>現場所見，消防船在魚排對開海面，不斷向魚排射水，救火期間警方協助封路，以便救援。火警約50分鐘後被救熄。起火船艇與一號魚排被燒至沉落海底，其餘有6至8隻纖維快艇被燒通頂亦沉到海底，但實際損毀船隻有待點算，火警中受傷的排主拒絕送院。</p>\n<img alt=\"消防不斷向魚排射水。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f808edd630cb54a3a13a5a18fbc526c4/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_07.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9238f68778bd48cbb7cf3dcb86eb3e7/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_06_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"火警現場是布袋澳1號和2號魚排。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d425b3c3dfa5c3e0a7d2060242ce197/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_06_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1cbb0831144dc4deb2e06a01b381160/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_06.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecabc9a955d566f897f40a354df5ed8b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_05_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防出動兩喉兩煙帽隊救火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afbc75562dbf4599da1e616a7044ccb2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_05_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/926fc3086168ef537e40c22d2fe2dec1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6eccc928530bf7c0967a01fc31a6f645/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_04_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/918205005d2d544eb57daf3c857fc360/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_04_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d799c7f54e438569c14223e3e25a0213/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_42_00.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方封路以便救援。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bffcc73f5057ee9f5aabddf22702f74/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_03.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/740dd275a4d0602e9055ac722f87c20d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_04.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T04:59:15.120327+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":537,"images":23,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}